  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Code Editor Typing\n\nA full code editor window (activity bar, explorer, tabs, terminal, status bar) types a snippet character by character with a caret, then tilts in 3D.\n\nCategory: ui-blocks. Length: 11 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A developer-facing video needs a believable code editor typing out a snippet.\n- The code should be easy to swap (one text variable).\n\nAvoid when:\n- You want a glass code card or a morphing diff: use glass-code-block or code-morph.\n- The snippet is longer than about 18 lines.\n\nVariables:\n- code (string): Code, default \"# A small functional toolkit\\ndef pluck_deep(key):\\n    return lambda obj: reduce(lambda acc, k: acc[k], key.split('.'), obj)\\n\\ndef compose(*fns):\\n    return lambda res: reduce(lambda acc, fn: fn(acc), fns, res)\\n\\ndef unfold(f, seed):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build a list by repeatedly applying f to a seed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    acc = []\\n    while True:\\n        result = f(seed)\\n        if result is None:\\n            return acc\\n        acc.append(result[0])\\n        seed = result[1]\\n\"\n- file_name (string): File name, default \"functional_toolkit.py\"\n- project_name (string): Project name, default \"functional-toolkit\"\n- kicker (string): Kicker, default \"Editor theme preview\"\n- title (string): Title, default \"Midnight\"\n- note (string): Note, default \"Typing a small file, with a tests terminal below.\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#0078d4\"\n- background_color (color): Background glow, default \"#1d2a4a\"\n- background_color_2 (color): Background base, default \"#0b0f1c\"\n\nSource: heygen-com/hyperframes. Licence: Apache-2.0. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Code Editor Typing\n\n  A full code editor window (activity bar, explorer, tabs, terminal, status bar) types a snippet character by character with a caret, then tilts in 3D.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/blob/bd6cff8157a1a0ed5075527e673cc4f321fe9123/registry/blocks/code-editor-typing/code-editor-typing.html\n\n  Copyright HeyGen, Inc. and the Hyperframes contributors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version\n  2.0 (the \"License\"); you may not use this file except in compliance with the License. You may obtain\n  a copy of the License at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0. Unless required by applicable\n  law or agreed to in writing, software distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\"\n  BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the License for\n  the specific language governing permissions and limitations under the License.\n\n  Changes by usemosio/blocks: adapted from a block themed on a well-known code editor: generic title, project and window text and a generic highlighter palette; the code is a variable with a small built-in Python-style tokenizer instead of hand-built token lists; the photo backdrop became a two-colour gradient; fills the host frame (a 1920x1080 design for wide frames, a 1080x1920 one for tall frames without the explorer, scaled to fit), caret positions are measured before the entrance tweens run, and Inter and JetBrains Mono come from Google Fonts.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"code-editor-typing\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"11\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"code\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Code\",\n    \"description\": \"The code that gets typed, up to 18 lines (a small Python-style highlighter colours it).\",\n    \"default\": \"# A small functional toolkit\\ndef pluck_deep(key):\\n    return lambda obj: reduce(lambda acc, k: acc[k], key.split(&#39;.&#39;), obj)\\n\\ndef compose(*fns):\\n    return lambda res: reduce(lambda acc, fn: fn(acc), fns, res)\\n\\ndef unfold(f, seed):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build a list by repeatedly applying f to a seed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    acc = []\\n    while True:\\n        result = f(seed)\\n        if result is None:\\n            return acc\\n        acc.append(result[0])\\n        seed = result[1]\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"file_name\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"File name\",\n    \"description\": \"Name on the tab and in the file tree.\",\n    \"default\": \"functional_toolkit.py\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"project_name\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Project name\",\n    \"description\": \"Name in the title bar, explorer and breadcrumbs.\",\n    \"default\": \"functional-toolkit\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"kicker\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Kicker\",\n    \"description\": \"Small line above the title.\",\n    \"default\": \"Editor theme preview\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"title\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Title\",\n    \"description\": \"Big title above the window.\",\n    \"default\": \"Midnight\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"note\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Note\",\n    \"description\": \"Small caption on the right of the title.\",\n    \"default\": \"Typing a small file, with a tests terminal below.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"accent_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Accent\",\n    \"description\": \"Active tab, status bar and activity bar accent.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0078d4\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"background_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background glow\",\n    \"description\": \"Light colour of the backdrop behind the window.\",\n    \"default\": \"#1d2a4a\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"background_color_2\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background base\",\n    \"description\": \"Dark colour of the backdrop behind the window.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0b0f1c\"\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Code Editor Typing</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; pointer-events: none; }\n          .cse-scene * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            letter-spacing: 0;\n          }\n\n          .cse-scene {\n            --activity-bg: #181818;\n            --activity-fg: #d7d7d7;\n            --activity-muted: #868686;\n            --activity-active: var(--cse-accent, #0078d4);\n            --sidebar-bg: #181818;\n            --sidebar-fg: #cccccc;\n            --sidebar-border: #2b2b2b;\n            --tab-bg: #181818;\n            --tab-active-bg: #1f1f1f;\n            --tab-active-fg: #ffffff;\n            --tab-inactive-fg: #9d9d9d;\n            --tab-border: #2b2b2b;\n            --editor-bg: #1f1f1f;\n            --editor-fg: #cccccc;\n            --editor-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n            --gutter-fg: #6e7681;\n            --gutter-active-fg: #cccccc;\n            --panel-bg: #181818;\n            --panel-border: #2b2b2b;\n            --status-bg: #181818;\n            --status-fg: #cccccc;\n            --status-border: #2b2b2b;\n            --title-bg: #181818;\n            --title-fg: #cccccc;\n            --token-comment: #6a9955;\n            --token-keyword: #c586c0;\n            --token-function: #dcdcaa;\n            --token-string: #ce9178;\n            --token-number: #b5cea8;\n            --token-variable: #9cdcfe;\n            --token-parameter: #9cdcfe;\n            --token-operator: #d4d4d4;\n            --token-punctuation: #d4d4d4;\n            --token-class-name: #4ec9b0;\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 50%;\n            top: 50%;\n            transform-origin: 0 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n          }\n\n          .scene-content {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            padding: 54px 70px 92px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 16px;\n            perspective: 2200px;\n            perspective-origin: 56% 52%;\n          }\n\n          .header {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: end;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            min-height: 66px;\n            text-shadow:\n              0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42),\n              0 14px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);\n          }\n\n          .kicker {\n            margin: 0 0 7px;\n            color: var(--gutter-fg);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            font-weight: 650;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            text-shadow:\n              0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48),\n              0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.36);\n          }\n\n          .title {\n            margin: 0;\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n            font-size: 44px;\n            line-height: 1;\n            font-weight: 760;\n          }\n\n          .source-note {\n            width: 510px;\n            color: var(--gutter-fg);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.35;\n            text-align: right;\n            text-shadow:\n              0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.46),\n              0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);\n          }\n\n          .workbench {\n            height: var(--wb-h, 824px);\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: var(--wb-cols, 54px 290px 1fr);\n            grid-template-rows: 36px 1fr 26px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            background: var(--editor-bg);\n            box-shadow: 0 34px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);\n            transform: translateZ(0);\n            transform-origin: 82% 50%;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            will-change: transform;\n          }\n\n          .titlebar {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr 210px;\n            align-items: center;\n            background: var(--title-bg);\n            color: var(--title-fg);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tab-border);\n            font-size: 12px;\n          }\n\n          .traffic {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 8px;\n            padding-left: 18px;\n          }\n\n          .traffic span {\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            border-radius: 999px;\n          }\n\n          .traffic span:nth-child(1) {\n            background: #ff5f57;\n          }\n          .traffic span:nth-child(2) {\n            background: #ffbd2e;\n          }\n          .traffic span:nth-child(3) {\n            background: #28c840;\n          }\n\n          .window-title {\n            justify-self: center;\n            opacity: 0.84;\n          }\n\n          .command-center {\n            justify-self: end;\n            width: 176px;\n            height: 22px;\n            margin-right: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--title-fg), transparent 78%);\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--title-fg), transparent 18%);\n          }\n\n          .activity {\n            grid-row: 2 / 3;\n            background: var(--activity-bg);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            gap: 18px;\n          }\n\n          .activity-icon {\n            width: 28px;\n            height: 28px;\n            color: var(--activity-muted);\n          }\n\n          .activity-icon.active {\n            color: var(--activity-fg);\n            border-left: 2px solid var(--activity-active);\n            padding-left: 4px;\n          }\n\n          .sidebar {\n            grid-row: 2 / 3;\n            background: var(--sidebar-bg);\n            color: var(--sidebar-fg);\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            min-width: 0;\n          }\n\n          .sidebar-title {\n            height: 38px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            color: var(--sidebar-fg);\n            font-size: 11px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n          }\n\n          .section-title {\n            height: 24px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n            padding: 0 14px;\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sidebar-bg), var(--sidebar-fg) 5%);\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);\n            color: var(--sidebar-fg);\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n          }\n\n          .tree {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 24px;\n          }\n\n          .tree-row {\n            height: 24px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 7px;\n            padding: 0 10px 0 18px;\n            color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sidebar-fg), transparent 8%);\n            white-space: nowrap;\n          }\n\n          .tree-row.child {\n            padding-left: 34px;\n          }\n\n          .tree-row.selected {\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sidebar-fg), transparent 88%);\n            color: var(--sidebar-fg);\n          }\n\n          .editor-area {\n            grid-row: 2 / 3;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-rows: 36px 30px 1fr 138px;\n            min-width: 0;\n            background: var(--editor-bg);\n          }\n\n          .tabs {\n            display: flex;\n            background: var(--tab-bg);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tab-border);\n          }\n\n          .tab {\n            width: 205px;\n            height: 36px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            padding: 0 13px;\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--tab-border);\n            background: var(--tab-active-bg);\n            color: var(--tab-active-fg);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--activity-active);\n            font-size: 13px;\n          }\n\n          .tab.inactive {\n            background: var(--tab-bg);\n            color: var(--tab-inactive-fg);\n            border-top-color: transparent;\n          }\n\n          .breadcrumbs {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 7px;\n            padding: 0 18px;\n            color: var(--gutter-fg);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tab-border), transparent 20%);\n            font-size: 12px;\n          }\n\n          .editor {\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--editor-bg);\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n            font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            line-height: 1.52;\n          }\n\n          .active-line {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            height: 28px;\n            background: var(--editor-line);\n            will-change: transform;\n          }\n\n          .code {\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 20px 36px 18px 0;\n          }\n\n          .line {\n            height: 28px;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;\n            align-items: center;\n          }\n\n          .line-number {\n            padding-right: 18px;\n            color: var(--gutter-fg);\n            text-align: right;\n            user-select: none;\n          }\n\n          .line.is-active .line-number {\n            color: var(--gutter-active-fg);\n          }\n\n          .line-code {\n            white-space: pre;\n          }\n\n          .char {\n            opacity: 0;\n          }\n\n          .tok-comment {\n            color: var(--token-comment);\n          }\n          .tok-keyword {\n            color: var(--token-keyword);\n          }\n          .tok-function {\n            color: var(--token-function);\n          }\n          .tok-string {\n            color: var(--token-string);\n          }\n          .tok-number {\n            color: var(--token-number);\n          }\n          .tok-variable {\n            color: var(--token-variable);\n          }\n          .tok-parameter {\n            color: var(--token-parameter);\n          }\n          .tok-operator {\n            color: var(--token-operator);\n          }\n          .tok-punctuation {\n            color: var(--token-punctuation);\n          }\n          .tok-class-name {\n            color: var(--token-class-name);\n          }\n\n          .caret {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 3;\n            display: block;\n            width: 2px;\n            height: 22px;\n            background: var(--editor-fg);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            will-change: transform, opacity;\n          }\n\n          .terminal {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-rows: 32px 1fr;\n            background: var(--panel-bg);\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n            font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n            font-size: 14px;\n          }\n\n          .panel-tabs {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 22px;\n            padding: 0 18px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n            color: var(--gutter-fg);\n            font-family:\n              Inter,\n              \n              BlinkMacSystemFont,\n              \"Segoe UI\",\n              sans-serif;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n          }\n\n          .panel-tabs .active {\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--activity-active);\n            height: 32px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n          }\n\n          .terminal-body {\n            padding: 12px 20px;\n            color: var(--editor-fg);\n            line-height: 1.8;\n          }\n\n          .prompt {\n            color: var(--token-function);\n          }\n\n          .statusbar {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            background: var(--status-bg);\n            color: var(--status-fg);\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--status-border);\n            font-size: 12px;\n          }\n\n          .status-left,\n          .status-right {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 18px;\n            padding: 0 12px;\n          }\n\n          .remote {\n            align-self: stretch;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 0 12px;\n            margin-left: -12px;\n            background: var(--status-remote-bg, var(--activity-active));\n            color: var(--status-remote-fg, #ffffff);\n          }\n\n          .cse-scene svg {\n            display: block;\n          }\n\n          .cse-portrait .scene-content { padding: 70px 40px 80px; }\n          .cse-portrait .header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; }\n          .cse-portrait .source-note { width: 100%; text-align: left; }\n          .cse-portrait .title { font-size: 64px; }\n          .cse-portrait .kicker { font-size: 20px; }\n          .cse-portrait .source-note { font-size: 20px; }\n          .cse-portrait .activity, .cse-portrait .sidebar { display: none; }\n          .cse-portrait .editor { font-size: 20px; }\n          .cse-portrait .line { grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr; }\n          .cse-portrait .code { padding-top: 24px; }\n          .cse-portrait .terminal { font-size: 18px; }\n          .cse-portrait .tab { width: 260px; font-size: 16px; }\n          .cse-portrait .breadcrumbs { font-size: 14px; }\n\n      </style>\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"code-editor-typing\" data-duration=\"11\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"cse-clip\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"11\" data-track-index=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0\">\n          <div id=\"cse-scene\" class=\"cse-scene\" style=\"--activity-bg:#181818;--activity-fg:#d7d7d7;--activity-muted:#868686;--sidebar-bg:#181818;--sidebar-fg:#cccccc;--sidebar-border:#2b2b2b;--tab-bg:#181818;--tab-active-bg:#1f1f1f;--tab-active-fg:#ffffff;--tab-inactive-fg:#9d9d9d;--tab-border:#2b2b2b;--editor-bg:#1f1f1f;--editor-fg:#cccccc;--editor-line:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--gutter-fg:#6e7681;--gutter-active-fg:#cccccc;--panel-bg:#181818;--panel-border:#2b2b2b;--status-bg:#181818;--status-fg:#cccccc;--status-border:#2b2b2b;--title-bg:#181818;--title-fg:#cccccc;--token-comment:#6a9955;--token-keyword:#c586c0;--token-function:#dcdcaa;--token-string:#ce9178;--token-number:#b5cea8;--token-variable:#9cdcfe;--token-parameter:#9cdcfe;--token-operator:#d4d4d4;--token-punctuation:#d4d4d4;--token-class-name:#4ec9b0;color:#cccccc;\">\n            <main class=\"scene-content\">\n              <section class=\"header\">\n                <div>\n                  <p class=\"kicker\" id=\"cse-kicker\"></p>\n                  <h1 class=\"title\"><span id=\"cse-title\"></span></h1>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"source-note\" id=\"cse-note\"></p>\n              </section>\n              <section class=\"workbench\">\n                <div class=\"titlebar\">\n                  <div class=\"traffic\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                  <div class=\"window-title\" id=\"cse-window\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"command-center\">Search</div>\n                </div>\n                <aside class=\"activity\" aria-label=\"Activity bar\">\n                  <svg class=\"activity-icon active\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4 4h7v7H4V4Zm9 0h7v7h-7V4ZM4 13h7v7H4v-7Zm9 0h7v7h-7v-7Z\" /></svg>\n                  <svg class=\"activity-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m21 21-5.2-5.2M10.5 18a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 0-15 7.5 7.5 0 0 1 0 15Z\" /></svg>\n                  <svg class=\"activity-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 18 3 12l5-6m8 12 5-6-5-6\" /></svg>\n                  <svg class=\"activity-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 3v18m0-18 6 6m-6-6L6 9m6 12 6-6m-6 6-6-6\" /></svg>\n                </aside>\n                <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n                  <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Explorer</div>\n                  <div class=\"section-title\" id=\"cse-proj-head\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"tree\">\n                    <div class=\"tree-row\">&#8964; src</div>\n                    <div class=\"tree-row child selected\" id=\"cse-tree-file\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"tree-row child\">&#9671; test_toolkit.py</div>\n                    <div class=\"tree-row\">&#9671; pyproject.toml</div>\n                    <div class=\"tree-row\">&#9671; README.md</div>\n                  </div>\n                </aside>\n                <section class=\"editor-area\">\n                  <div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab\" id=\"cse-tab\"></div><div class=\"tab inactive\">README.md</div></div>\n                  <div class=\"breadcrumbs\" id=\"cse-crumbs\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"editor\"><div class=\"active-line\"></div><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n                  <div class=\"terminal\">\n                    <div class=\"panel-tabs\"><span class=\"active\">Terminal</span><span>Problems</span><span>Output</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"terminal-body\" id=\"cse-term\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </section>\n                <footer class=\"statusbar\">\n                  <div class=\"status-left\"><span class=\"remote\">main</span><span>0 errors</span><span>0 warnings</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"status-right\"><span>Ln 17, Col 1</span><span>Spaces: 4</span><span>UTF-8</span><span>Python 3.12</span></div>\n                </footer>\n              </section>\n            </main>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            function str(x, f) { return typeof x === \"string\" && x.trim() ? x : f; }\n            function col(x, f) { return typeof x === \"string\" && x.trim() ? x.trim() : f; }\n            var DEFAULT_CODE = \"# A small functional toolkit\\ndef pluck_deep(key):\\n    return lambda obj: reduce(lambda acc, k: acc[k], key.split('.'), obj)\\n\\ndef compose(*fns):\\n    return lambda res: reduce(lambda acc, fn: fn(acc), fns, res)\\n\\ndef unfold(f, seed):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Build a list by repeatedly applying f to a seed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    acc = []\\n    while True:\\n        result = f(seed)\\n        if result is None:\\n            return acc\\n        acc.append(result[0])\\n        seed = result[1]\\n\";\n            var code = str(vars.code, DEFAULT_CODE).replace(/\\t/g, \"    \").split(/\\r?\\n/).slice(0, 18);\n            var file = str(vars.file_name, \"functional_toolkit.py\");\n            var project = str(vars.project_name, \"functional-toolkit\");\n            var scene = document.getElementById(\"cse-scene\");\n            scene.style.setProperty(\"--cse-accent\", col(vars.accent_color, \"#0078d4\"));\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-kicker\").textContent = str(vars.kicker, \"Editor theme preview\");\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-title\").textContent = str(vars.title, \"Midnight\");\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-note\").textContent = str(vars.note, \"Typing a small file, with a tests terminal below.\");\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-window\").textContent = project + \" - Code Editor\";\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-proj-head\").textContent = \"\\u2304 \" + project;\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-tree-file\").textContent = \"\\u25C7 \" + file;\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-tab\").textContent = \"\\u25C7 \" + file;\n            document.getElementById(\"cse-crumbs\").textContent = project + \" \\u203A src \\u203A \" + file;\n            var term = document.getElementById(\"cse-term\");\n            [[\"<span class=\\\"prompt\\\">\" + project.replace(/</g, \"&lt;\") + \" %</span> python -m pytest\"], [\"collected 3 items\"], [\"tests/test_toolkit.py ... <span class=\\\"tok-comment\\\">passed</span>\"]].forEach(function (r) { var d = document.createElement(\"div\"); d.innerHTML = r[0]; term.appendChild(d); });\n\n            // Background: two colours, with a soft glow, behind the window.\n            var bgA = col(vars.background_color, \"#1d2a4a\"), bgB = col(vars.background_color_2, \"#0b0f1c\");\n            root.style.background = \"radial-gradient(120% 90% at 20% 15%, \" + bgA + \" 0%, \" + bgB + \" 70%), \" + bgB;\n\n            // Design size: 1920x1080 for wide frames, 1080x1920 for tall ones; the scene is scaled to fit.\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920;\n            var portrait = H > W;\n            var DW = portrait ? 1080 : 1920, DH = portrait ? 1920 : 1080;\n            var s = Math.min(W / DW, H / DH);\n            scene.style.width = DW + \"px\"; scene.style.height = DH + \"px\";\n            scene.style.transform = \"translate(\" + (-DW * s / 2) + \"px,\" + (-DH * s / 2) + \"px) scale(\" + s + \")\";\n            if (portrait) {\n              scene.classList.add(\"cse-portrait\");\n              scene.style.setProperty(\"--wb-h\", \"1500px\");\n              scene.style.setProperty(\"--wb-cols\", \"1fr\");\n            }\n            var CODE_LINE = portrait ? 34 : 28;\n            if (portrait) scene.style.setProperty(\"--cse-line\", CODE_LINE + \"px\");\n\n            // A small Python-style tokenizer.\n            var KEYWORDS = /^(def|return|lambda|while|if|elif|else|for|in|is|not|and|or|import|from|class|try|except|with|as|pass|yield|raise|break|continue|async|await)$/;\n            var CONSTS = /^(True|False|None)$/;\n            function tokenize(line) {\n              var out = [], i = 0, prevDef = false;\n              while (i < line.length) {\n                var rest = line.slice(i), m;\n                if ((m = /^#.*/.exec(rest))) { out.push([m[0], \"comment\"]); i += m[0].length; continue; }\n                if ((m = /^(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|'''[\\s\\S]*?'''|\"(?:[^\"\\\\]|\\\\.)*\"|'(?:[^'\\\\]|\\\\.)*')/.exec(rest))) { out.push([m[0], \"string\"]); i += m[0].length; continue; }\n                if ((m = /^\\d+(\\.\\d+)?/.exec(rest))) { out.push([m[0], \"number\"]); i += m[0].length; continue; }\n                if ((m = /^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*/.exec(rest))) {\n                  var w = m[0], after = line.charAt(i + w.length), kind;\n                  if (KEYWORDS.test(w)) { kind = \"keyword\"; }\n                  else if (CONSTS.test(w)) { kind = \"class-name\"; }\n                  else if (prevDef || after === \"(\") { kind = \"function\"; }\n                  else { kind = \"variable\"; }\n                  prevDef = w === \"def\" || w === \"class\";\n                  out.push([w, kind]); i += w.length; continue;\n                }\n                if ((m = /^\\s+/.exec(rest))) { out.push([m[0], \"plain\"]); i += m[0].length; continue; }\n                out.push([rest.charAt(0), /[=+\\-*\\/<>!%]/.test(rest.charAt(0)) ? \"operator\" : \"punctuation\"]); i += 1;\n              }\n              return out;\n            }\n\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function build() {\n              tl.clear();\n              var codeEl = scene.querySelector(\".code\");\n              var editor = scene.querySelector(\".editor\");\n              codeEl.textContent = \"\";\n              var oldCaret = editor.querySelector(\".caret\");\n              if (oldCaret) oldCaret.remove();\n              code.forEach(function (text, index) {\n                var line = document.createElement(\"div\");\n                line.className = \"line\";\n                if (portrait) line.style.height = CODE_LINE + \"px\";\n                var num = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                num.className = \"line-number\";\n                num.textContent = String(index + 1);\n                line.appendChild(num);\n                var lc = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                lc.className = \"line-code\";\n                tokenize(text).forEach(function (seg) {\n                  Array.from(seg[0]).forEach(function (ch) {\n                    var sp = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                    sp.className = seg[1] === \"plain\" ? \"char\" : \"char tok-\" + seg[1];\n                    sp.textContent = ch;\n                    lc.appendChild(sp);\n                  });\n                });\n                line.appendChild(lc);\n                codeEl.appendChild(line);\n              });\n              var caret = document.createElement(\"span\");\n              caret.className = \"caret\";\n              editor.appendChild(caret);\n              if (portrait) { caret.style.height = \"30px\"; scene.querySelector(\".active-line\").style.height = CODE_LINE + \"px\"; }\n\n              var activeLine = scene.querySelector(\".active-line\");\n              var lineEls = gsap.utils.toArray(scene.querySelectorAll(\".line\"));\n              gsap.set([scene.querySelector(\".header\"), scene.querySelector(\".workbench\"), scene.querySelector(\".terminal\"), term.children, activeLine], { clearProps: \"all\" });\n              gsap.set(caret, { clearProps: \"all\" });\n              // Measure first, before any entrance transform is applied. Rects are in screen px, so divide by the scale.\n              var eb = editor.getBoundingClientRect();\n              function atChar(el) { var b = el.getBoundingClientRect(); return { x: (b.right - eb.left) / s + 2, y: (b.top - eb.top) / s + 3 }; }\n              function atLine(line) { var b = line.getBoundingClientRect(), c = line.querySelector(\".line-code\").getBoundingClientRect(); return { x: (c.left - eb.left) / s, y: (b.top - eb.top) / s + 3 }; }\n              function lineY(line) { return (line.getBoundingClientRect().top - eb.top) / s; }\n              var starts = [], sched = [], cursor = 0.95;\n              lineEls.forEach(function (line, li) {\n                var chars = gsap.utils.toArray(line.querySelectorAll(\".char\"));\n                starts[li] = cursor;\n                chars.forEach(function (ch, ci) { sched.push({ ch: ch, t: cursor + ci * 0.012, p: atChar(ch) }); });\n                cursor += Math.max(chars.length * 0.012, 0.08) + 0.045;\n              });\n              var lineInfo = lineEls.map(function (l) { return { y: lineY(l), p: atLine(l) }; });\n\n              gsap.set(activeLine, { y: lineInfo[0].y });\n              gsap.set(caret, lineInfo[0].p);\n              tl.from(scene.querySelector(\".header\"), { y: 24, opacity: 0, duration: 0.45, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0);\n              tl.from(scene.querySelector(\".workbench\"), { y: 42, opacity: 0, scale: 0.986, duration: 0.58, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.1);\n              tl.from(activeLine, { opacity: 0, duration: 0.22, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0.74);\n              starts.forEach(function (t, li) {\n                tl.set(activeLine, { y: lineInfo[li].y }, t);\n                tl.set(caret, lineInfo[li].p, t);\n                tl.call(function () { lineEls.forEach(function (it) { it.classList.toggle(\"is-active\", it === lineEls[li]); }); }, [], t);\n              });\n              sched.forEach(function (c) {\n                tl.set(c.ch, { opacity: 1 }, c.t);\n                tl.set(caret, c.p, c.t + 0.002);\n              });\n              tl.to(caret, { opacity: 0, duration: 0.34, repeat: 25, yoyo: true, ease: \"steps(1)\" }, 0.95);\n              var tEnd = Math.max(cursor, 7.55);\n              tl.from(scene.querySelector(\".terminal\"), { y: 140, opacity: 0, duration: 0.56, ease: \"power3.out\" }, tEnd);\n              tl.from(term.children, { opacity: 0, y: 8, duration: 0.24, stagger: 0.16, ease: \"power2.out\" }, tEnd + 0.5);\n              var wb = scene.querySelector(\".workbench\");\n              tl.to(wb, { rotateY: -10.5, z: 74, duration: 0.72, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 9.35);\n              tl.to(wb, { rotateY: 0, z: 0, duration: 0.62, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 10.08);\n              if (tl.duration() < 11) tl.to({}, { duration: 11 - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n            }\n            build();\n            if (document.fonts && document.fonts.ready) document.fonts.ready.then(function () { build(); }, function () {});\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"code-editor-typing\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
